{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは～ティー・チャンです\n(てぃすが命名し、純奈とかりんたちも呼んでくるあだ名)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この最近買った\n柔らかいぴんくいろのワンピが\nかわいくてお気に入り。\nそして\n流行りのリボンラリエット。\n最近よく買っちゃう。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かみはゆるっとまいて。\nメイクは、ピンク系で統一"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうは、\nアルバムの握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんなに\n髪どうしよーってゆったら\nハーフツイン！といわれたので\nそうした٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命は美しいの真夏ver"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪色抜けてだいぶ茶髪なので\n次何色にしようか迷い中～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、\nツアー行くよーとか\nスペイベいくよーって会話をおもに！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアー楽しみ(｡•ω•｡)﻿〃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな\nハートサイリウム用意しといてね♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～まだハーフツインいけますかね?\nいやきついよね。うん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の浴衣\nなに色がかわいいとおもう?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おうちのは\n白にピンク色の柄をもってるのだけど\n新しいのがほしくって～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～なやむ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/10/5852380/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}